          </div>
          <div class="p-3 bg-brand-light rounded-lg border border-brand-border">
            <strong class="text-brand-dark block text-sm">新加坡 (SG)</strong>
            <span class="text-blue-700 font-bold">延迟: 55ms–85ms</span>
            <p class="text-[11px] mt-1">东南亚网络枢纽，网络环境极度自由，是运行大模型生产力工具的黄金备选地。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 bg-brand-light rounded-lg border border-brand-border">
            <strong class="text-brand-dark block text-sm">美西洛杉矶 (US)</strong>
            <span class="text-purple-700 font-bold">延迟: 130ms–165ms</span>
            <p class="text-[11px] mt-1">全球互联网大本营，版权最全、AI 兼容性最高，延迟虽高但不影响大带宽看 4K。</p>
